# ─── OUR WORLD: FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES ───────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to frontend/.env.local and fill in your values.
#
# ⚠️ Safe to commit this .example file. NEVER commit .env.local or secret keys.
# ⚠️ Frontend uses ONLY the publishable anon key. Access is governed by Supabase RLS.

# 1. Supabase Project URL (Found in: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API → Project URL)
# Example: https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=

# 2. Supabase Anon / Publishable Key (Found in: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API → Project API Keys → anon / public)
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# 3. Backend FastAPI URL
# Default local development URL: http://localhost:8000
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
